Verify sample browser scrolling works correctly. (Verify only)

The sample browser file list should scroll when there are more files
than fit in the panel. This may already work via Nuklear's group widget.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] File list scrolls when entries exceed visible area
- [ ] Scroll bar visible and functional
- [ ] Selected file stays visible after scroll
- [ ] No rendering issues at scroll boundaries

## Test Plan
- [ ] Navigate to directory with 50+ files, verify scrolling works
- [ ] Scroll to bottom, verify last file visible and clickable
- [ ] Select a file, scroll away and back, verify selection preserved
